        "industries.title": "Industries · Builtly Engineering",
        "industries.desc": "Builtly is the production layer for regulated engineering deliverables — built for consultancies and available to developers, lenders, asset managers and public-sector teams through controlled access routes.",
        "industries.hero.eyebrow": "Industries and users",
        "industries.hero.h1": "Built for engineering consultancies.<br/>Useful to the clients around them.",
        "industries.hero.lede": "Builtly is the production layer for regulated engineering deliverables. Engineering consultancies use it to standardise, accelerate and quality-assure report production; developers, lenders, asset managers and public-sector teams use selected modules when they need a structured technical basis earlier in the decision process. <span class=\"serif\">One platform. Professional accountability preserved.</span>",
        "industries.meta.r1.k": "Primary customer",
