      "home2.title": "Builtly · Consulting engineers with our own software",
      "industries.desc": "Builtly Software is used by engineering consultancies, property developers, lenders and public-sector teams. Builtly also delivers consulting engagements of its own — the software is built on real deliveries.",
      "industries.hero.h1": "Who the software is built for.",
      "industries.hero.lede": "Builtly Software is used by engineering consultancies, property developers, lenders, asset managers and public-sector teams — as a licence, direct purchase or partner integration. And because Builtly takes on consulting engagements of its own, the modules are built on real deliveries: calculations, local rules, quality assurance and signed documents.",
